# Semgrep ignore — generated/pasted trees only (gitignore-style syntax).
#
# Patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash so they target ONLY the
# top-level trees and never real source dirs that happen to be named the
# same (e.g. frontend/src/pages/docs, frontend/src/lib/docs stay scanned).
# Real source (frontend/**, cloudflare-worker/**, backend/**) and all test
# directories remain fully scanned.

# Committed Vite/Rollup build output (minified bundles) served by GitHub
# Pages. Regenerated by `npm run build`.
/docs/

# Pasted attachments (Pasted-*.txt, decks, docs) — meta/prompt text and
# example values, not live secrets or real code.
/attached_assets/
